card.statement:
A tableau $T(U)$ of type $D$ is called $D$-standard if for any $2\leq k\leq n$, the following conditions are satisfied:

\begin{align}
&-u'_{k,2}\geq u_{k,1}>u'_{k2}\geq u_{k2}> \cdots > u'_{k,k-1}\geq u_{k,k-1}> u'_{k,k}\geq u_{k,k}.\\
&-u'_{k,2}\geq u_{k-1,1}>u'_{k,2}\geq u_{k-1,2}> \cdots> u'_{k,k-1}\geq u_{k-1,k-1}> u'_{k,k}.
\end{align}
